<doc id="200535" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200535" title="Raden Durgandasena">
Raden Durgandasena

Miturut crita &lt;a href="Pedhalangan"&gt;padhalangan&lt;/a&gt;, Raden Durgandasena iku klebu golonganing &lt;a href="Kurawa"&gt;Kurawa&lt;/a&gt;. Tokoh iki mung tinemu ing wayang purwa lakon Karna Tandhing (seri &lt;a href="Bharatayuda"&gt;Bharatayuda&lt;/a&gt;). Raden Durgandasena pinercaya dening &lt;a href="Duryodana"&gt;Prabu Duryudana&lt;/a&gt; minangka pengampinge Senapati Agung (Mahasenapati) &lt;a href="Karna"&gt;Prabu Karna&lt;/a&gt;.
Kacarita Perang Bharatayuda wus tumapak nembelas dina. Senapati bebeteng Ngastina apadene senapati agul-aguling Pandhawa wus akeh kang gugur ing paprangan. Ing pihak Kurawa antarane: &lt;a href="Bisma"&gt;Resi Bisma&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bhagadatta"&gt;Prabu Bogadenta&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prabu%20Gardhapati"&gt;Prabu Gardhapati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Prabu%20Wresaya"&gt;Prabu Wresaya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Raden%20Sarojakusuma"&gt;Raden Sarojakusuma&lt;/a&gt; (Lesmana Mandrakumara), &lt;a href="Jayadrata"&gt;Raden Jayadrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Burisrawa"&gt;Raden Burisrawa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Drona"&gt;Pandhita Drona&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Duhsasana"&gt;Raden Dursasana&lt;/a&gt;.
Wondene ing pihak Pandhawa kang gugur ing madyaning paprangan antarane: &lt;a href="Resi%20Seta"&gt;Resi Seta&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Utara"&gt;Raden Utara&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Arya%20Sangka"&gt;Raden Wratsangka&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Abimanyu"&gt;Raden Abimanyu&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Gathotkaca"&gt;Raden Gathutkaca&lt;/a&gt;.
Byar padhang dina kaping pitulas, Raden Durgandasena sing kapatah dadi pengampinge Prabu Karna wis ngirit wadyabala Kurawa tumuju &lt;a href="Kurusetra"&gt;Tegal Kurusetra&lt;/a&gt;, ndhisiki maju perang; mbabati ing ngarungkut. Jrone wektu kang ora suwe, Raden Durgandasena wis bisa mateni agul-aguling wadyabala Jodhipati.
Patih &lt;a href="Gagak%20Bongkol"&gt;Gagakbongkol&lt;/a&gt; (patihe &lt;a href="Bima%20%28paraga%20Mahabharata%29"&gt;Raden Wrekudara&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Kendhanggumulung"&gt;Kendhanggumulung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Macan%20Anggelur"&gt;Macananggelur&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dhandhangminangsi"&gt;Dhandhangminangsi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Banyaksakurungan"&gt;Banyaksakurungan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Raden%20Tambakganggeng"&gt;Tambakganggeng&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Raden%20Ganggengkanyut"&gt;Ganggengkanyut&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Andakasumelar"&gt;Andakasumelar&lt;/a&gt; sirna mungsuh Raden Durgandasena.
Raden Wrekudara duka banget bareng priksa balane akeh kang gugur dipateni Raden Durgandasena. Sigra cancut taliwanda methukake Durgandasena. Kekarone nuli perang tandhing.
Sawatara perange Raden Wrekudara lan Raden Durgandasena. Katon yen kekarone timbang kadigdayane. Nanging suwening suwe, Raden Durgandasena saya suda kekuwatane, satemah bisa dicandhak dening Raden Wrekudara, kasabetake ing watu gajah. Raden Durgandasena sirna margalayu. Kuwandane ajur dadi sawalang-walang. Eloking kahanan, ing papan kono nuli timbul sawijining tuk (sumber banyu). Banyu mili saka tuk mau dadi kali kang banjur sinebut Kali Rambut.
