Avengers: Age of Ultron

Avengers: Age of Ultron yaiku &lt;a href="Filem%20Adisatriya"&gt;filem adisatriya&lt;/a&gt; Amerika taun 2015 sing diusung saka pantha (tim) adisatriya &lt;a href="Marvel%20Comic"&gt;Marvel Comic&lt;/a&gt; karan Avenger. Diprodhuksi dening &lt;a href="Marvel%20Studios"&gt;Marvel Studios&lt;/a&gt; lan dianjrah (didistribusikan) dening &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Studios%20Motion%20Pictures"&gt;Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures&lt;/a&gt;, filem iki minangka sekuel saka filem &lt;a href="The%20Avengers%20%28filem%202012%29"&gt;The Avenger&lt;/a&gt; (2012) lan &lt;a href="Prat%C3%A9laning%20filem%20Marvel%20Cinematic%20Universe"&gt;filem ka-11&lt;/a&gt; jroning &lt;a href="Marvel%20Cinematic%20Universe"&gt;Marvel Cinematic Universe&lt;/a&gt; (MCU). Ditulis lan disutradharani dening &lt;a href="Joss%20Whedon"&gt;Joss Whedon&lt;/a&gt;, filem iki nampilaké &lt;a href="juru%20paraga%20pupulan"&gt;juru paraga pupulan&lt;/a&gt; (ensemble cast) kayata &lt;a href="Robert%20Downey%20Jr."&gt;Robert Downey Jr.&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Chris%20Hemsworth"&gt;Chris Hemsworth&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mark%20Ruffalo"&gt;Mark Ruffalo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Chris%20Evans%20%28aktor%29"&gt;Chris Evans&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Scarlett%20Johansson"&gt;Scarlett Johansson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jeremy%20Renner"&gt;Jeremy Renner&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Don%20Cheadle"&gt;Don Cheadle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Aaron%20Taylor-Johnson"&gt;Aaron Taylor-Johnson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Elizabeth%20Olsen"&gt;Elizabeth Olsen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Paul%20Bettany"&gt;Paul Bettany&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cobie%20Smulders"&gt;Cobie Smulders&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Anthony%20Mackie"&gt;Anthony Mackie&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hayley%20Atwell"&gt;Hayley Atwell&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Idris%20Elba"&gt;Idris Elba&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Linda%20Cardellini"&gt;Linda Cardellini&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Stellan%20Skarsg%C3%A5rd"&gt;Stellan Skarsgård&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="James%20Spader"&gt;James Spader&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Samuel%20L.%20Jackson"&gt;Samuel L. Jackson&lt;/a&gt;. Sajeroné filem, para &lt;a href="Avenger%20%28Marvel%20Cinematic%20Universe%29"&gt;Avenger&lt;/a&gt; tarung lumawan &lt;a href="Ultron%20%28Marvel%20Cinematic%20Universe%29"&gt;Ultron&lt;/a&gt; (Spader)—sawijiné &lt;a href="kacerdhasan%20gaw%C3%A9yan"&gt;kacerdhasan gawéyan&lt;/a&gt; cinipta dening &lt;a href="Tony%20Stark%20%28Marvel%20Cinematic%20Universe%29"&gt;Tony Stark&lt;/a&gt; (Downey) lan &lt;a href="Bruce%20Banner%20%28Marvel%20Cinematic%20Universe%29"&gt;Bruce Banner&lt;/a&gt; (Ruffalo)—sing kekarep nggawa tata tentrem donya kanthi cara &lt;a href="Kacuresan%20manungsa"&gt;nyuresaké manungsa&lt;/a&gt;.
Filem iki wis diumumaké ing Mei 2012 sawisé kasilé rilis filem The Avenger, kanthi Whedom bali minangka panulis uga sutradhara ing Agustus. Dhèwèké nganyari mula bukané Ultron ing filem kanggo nglebokaké pantha MCU Avenger lan ngenalaké paraga &lt;a href="Pietro%20%28Marvel%20Cinematic%20Universe%29"&gt;Pietro&lt;/a&gt; (Taylor-Johnson) saha &lt;a href="Wanda%20Maximoff%20%28Marvel%20Cinematic%20Universe%29"&gt;Wanda Maximoff&lt;/a&gt; (Olsen), ing ngendi Marvel pandum hak bareng &lt;a href="20th%20Century%20Fox"&gt;20th Century Fox&lt;/a&gt;. Pamilihan juru paraga wiwit ing Juni 2013 kanthi Downey bali napakasmani kontrak. &lt;a href="Regu%20Kapindo"&gt;Regu suting kapindo&lt;/a&gt; wiwit ing Februari 2014 ing Afrika Kidul, dene &lt;a href="Suting%20Utama"&gt;suting utama&lt;/a&gt; wiwit antarané Maret lan Agustus, utamané ing &lt;a href="Shepperton%20Studios"&gt;Shepperton Studios&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Surrey"&gt;Surrey&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;. Suting tambahan uga tumandang ing &lt;a href="Itali"&gt;Itali&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kor%C3%A9a%20Kidul"&gt;Koréa Kidul&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Banggalad%C3%A9sa"&gt;Banggaladésa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20York%20%28praja%29"&gt;praja New York&lt;/a&gt;, saha sakubengé Inggris. Kanthi pangudakara (estimasi) anggaran prodhuksi cacahé $365 yuta, filem iki minangka &lt;a href="Prat%C3%A9lan%C3%A9%20Film%20Paling%20Larang"&gt;sawijiné filem paling larang sing tau digarap&lt;/a&gt;.
Avengers: Age of Ultron tayang pratama ing &lt;a href="Hollywood"&gt;Hollywood, Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, ing 13 April 2015, banjur dirilis ing Amérika Sarékat ing 1 Mei, minangka pérangan saka MCU. Kanthi cara umum, filem iki dibiji apik dening para kritikawan lan nampa pangasilan kasar $1.4 punjul sak donya, ndadèkaké &lt;a href="Filem%20Ing%202015"&gt;filem kanthi pangasilan kasar paling dhuwur kapapat ing 2015&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Pratelan%C3%A9%20Filem%20Paling%20Dhuwur%20Pangasilan%20Kasar%C3%A9"&gt;filem kanthi pangasilan kasar paling dhuwur kalima sadawa mangsa&lt;/a&gt; nalika wayah tayangé. Rong sekuel saka filem iki wis dirilis, yaiku: (2018) lan (2019).

