<doc id="200683" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200683" title="Lucasfilm">
Lucasfilm

Lucasfilm Ltd. LLC yaiku &lt;a href="parusahan%20kirta"&gt;parusahan kirta&lt;/a&gt; filem lan tivi Amerika sing diadegaké dening juru filem (filmmaker) &lt;a href="George%20Lucas"&gt;George Lucas&lt;/a&gt; ing 10 Desember 1971, ing &lt;a href="Marin%2C%20California"&gt;county Marin, California&lt;/a&gt;, kutha &lt;a href="San%20Rafael"&gt;San Rafael&lt;/a&gt;, banjur ngalih marang &lt;a href="San%20Francisco"&gt;San Fransisco&lt;/a&gt; ing 2005. Parusahan iki kondang amarga nggarap waralaba &lt;a href="Star%20Wars"&gt;Star Wars&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Indiana%20Jones"&gt;Indiana Jones&lt;/a&gt;, saha amarga umuk ing babagan pangrembakan efek mirunggan, swara, lan &lt;a href="animasi%20komputer"&gt;animasi komputer&lt;/a&gt; kanggo filem. Kawit 2012, Lucasfilm minangka anak parusahan &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Studios"&gt;The Walt Disney Studios&lt;/a&gt;, sing uga ndarbèni tilas anak parusahan Lucasfilm &lt;a href="Pixar%20Animation%20Studios"&gt;Pixar&lt;/a&gt;.
Filem-filem parusahan iki kaya (1999), (2015), (2016), (2017), lan (2019) antarané &lt;a href="Prat%C3%A9lan%20filem%20palinh%20dhuwur%20pangasilan%20kasar%C3%A9"&gt;50 filem paling dhuwur pangasilan kasaré&lt;/a&gt; sakabeh mangsa, kanthi The Force Awakens minangka &lt;a href="Prat%C3%A9lan%20filem%20kanthi%20pangasilan%20kasar%C3%A9%20paling%20dhuwur%20ing%20Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat%20lan%20Kanada"&gt;filem kanthi pangasilan kasaré paling dhuwur ing Amérika Sarékat lan Kanada&lt;/a&gt;. Ing 30 Oktober 2012 Disney nulih (mengakuisisi) Lucasfilm kanthi nilai $4.05 milyar awujud kontan tur saham (padha karo udakara $ &amp;nbsp;milyar dina iki). Lucasfilm sapréné minangka siji saka limang sanggar (studio) filem lakon nyata (live-action) jroning Walt Disney Studios, bebarengan karo &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Pictures"&gt;Walt Disney Pictures&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Marvel%20Studios"&gt;Marvel Studios&lt;/a&gt;.

</doc>
<doc id="200684" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200684" title="Disney Entertainment">
Disney Entertainment

