<doc id="200685" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200685" title="Sarékat dagang">
Sarékat dagang

Sarékat dagang yaiku bebadan sing diadegaké uga dibandhani dening parusahan-parusahan sing lumaku ing &lt;a href="indhustri"&gt;indhustri&lt;/a&gt; tartamtu. Kanthi tembayatan antarané parusahan-parusahan ing sawijiné &lt;a href="Widang%20usaha"&gt;widang&lt;/a&gt;, sarekat dagang nglarasgawé (mengkoordinasi) babagan &lt;a href="ubungan%20masarakat"&gt;ubungan masarakat&lt;/a&gt;. Tuladhané &lt;a href="pariwara"&gt;pariwara&lt;/a&gt;, panggulawenthah, pambabaran, lan utamané &lt;a href="rerimuk"&gt;rerimuk&lt;/a&gt; (lobi) uga &lt;a href="tumindak%20rajaniti"&gt;tumindak rajaniti&lt;/a&gt; (political action). Sarekat bisa nyawisaké leladi liya, misalé nyepakaké parepatan (konferensi), ngrantam bebakuning indhustri, ngrantam &lt;a href="swauger%20indhustri"&gt;swauger indhustri&lt;/a&gt; (industry self-regulation), nganakaké jejaringan (networking) utawa acara-acara amal. Sarekat uga bisa nawakaké kelas utawa bahan-bahan panggulawenthah. Sapérangan gedhé sarekat iku arupa &lt;a href="paguyuban%20nirlaba"&gt;paguyuban nirlaba&lt;/a&gt; sing diatur dening &lt;a href="pakanata"&gt;pakanata&lt;/a&gt; (bylaws) lan dipanggedhéni pangurus sing uga anggota.
Sarékat dagang lan paguyuban-paguyuban indhustri liya ndarbé prabawa rajaniti sing gedhé ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Karajan%20Manunggal"&gt;Karajan Manunggal&lt;/a&gt;, saha nagara-nagara liya. Bebadan iki ngrererimuk pangrèh lan juru rajaniti. Dhèwèké uga mènèhi modhal akèh ing pambabaran, pariwara, uga wujud-wujud &lt;a href="nadukara"&gt;nadukara&lt;/a&gt; (advocacy) isu liya. 

</doc>
<doc id="200686" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200686" title="Marvel Comics">
Marvel Comics

Marvel Comics yaiku &lt;a href="pambabar"&gt;pambabar&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="komik"&gt;komik&lt;/a&gt; Amerika, sawijiné rajadarbé (properti) duwèké &lt;a href="The%20Walt%20Disney%20Company"&gt;Walt Disney Company&lt;/a&gt; kawit 31 Desember 2009, lan uga minangka anak parusahan &lt;a href="Disney%20Publishing%20Wordwide"&gt;Disney Publishing Wordwide&lt;/a&gt; kawit Maret 2023. Marvel diadegaké ing 1939 dening &lt;a href="Martin%20Goodman%20%28pambabar%29"&gt;Martin Goodman&lt;/a&gt; kanthi aran &lt;a href="Timely%20Comics"&gt;Timely Comics&lt;/a&gt;, lan ing 1951 ditepungi kanthi jeneng &lt;a href="Atlas%20Comics"&gt;Atlas Comics&lt;/a&gt;. Jamané Marvel wiwit ing Agustus 1961 kanthi dibabaré &lt;a href="The%20Fantastic%20Four%20%28komik%29"&gt;The Fantastic Four&lt;/a&gt; lan irah-irah adiwira liya anggitané &lt;a href="Stan%20Lee"&gt;Stan Lee&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jack%20Kirby"&gt;Jack Kirby&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Steve%20Ditko"&gt;Steve Ditko&lt;/a&gt;, lan sawetara panganggit liya. Mèrek Marvel, sing wis diguna mataun-taun banjur diteguhaké minangka mèrek utama parusahan. Pambesut komik &lt;a href="Stephen%20Wacker"&gt;Stephen Wacker&lt;/a&gt; sapréné minangka &lt;a href="Kapala%20redhaksi"&gt;kapala redhaksiné&lt;/a&gt;, sing njabat kawit Juli 2026. 
Marvel ndarbé wetara adiwira kondhang ing antarané jèjèran &lt;a href="Pratelan%20paraga-paraga%20adiwira%20Marvel%20Comics"&gt;paragané&lt;/a&gt;, kayata &lt;a href="Spider-Man"&gt;Spider-Man&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wolverine"&gt;Wolverine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hulk"&gt;Hulk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Captain%20America"&gt;Captain America&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iron%20Man"&gt;Iron Man&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Thor"&gt;Thor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daredevil"&gt;Daredevil&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Black%20Panther"&gt;Black Panther&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Doctor%20Strange"&gt;Doctor Strange&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Captain%20Marvel"&gt;Captain Marvel&lt;/a&gt;. Samana uga &lt;a href="Pratelan%20pantha%20lan%20bebadan%20ing%20Marvel%20Comics"&gt;pantha-pantha&lt;/a&gt; (tim-tim) misuwur tuladhané &lt;a href="Avengers"&gt;Avengers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="X-Men"&gt;X-Men&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Fantastic%20Four"&gt;Fantastic Four&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Guardians%20of%20the%20Galaxy"&gt;Guardians of the Galaxy&lt;/a&gt;. Marvel uga ndarbé &lt;a href="adidurjana"&gt;adidurjana&lt;/a&gt; (supervillain) sing tansah misuwur misalé &lt;a href="Doctor%20Doom"&gt;Doctor Doom&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Magneto"&gt;Magneto&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Green%20Goblin"&gt;Green Goblin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kingpin"&gt;Kingpin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Red%20Skull"&gt;Red Skull&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Loki"&gt;Loki&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ultron"&gt;Ultron&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Thanos"&gt;Thanos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Apocalypse"&gt;Apocalypse&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Galactus"&gt;Galactus&lt;/a&gt;. Akèh-akèh paraga rekan Marvel urip ing jagad tunggal karan &lt;a href="Marvel%20Universe"&gt;Marvel Universe&lt;/a&gt;, ing ngendi akèh papan diturun saka papan asli ing donya nyata; sapérangan gedhé paraga utama urip ing kutha New York. Kajaba kuwi, Marvel uga mbabar sawetara rajadarbé kalisensi parusahan liya. Kaya &lt;a href="komik%20Star%20Wars"&gt;komik Star Wars&lt;/a&gt; kaping pindho ing 1977 nganti 1987, lan manèh kawit 2015.

