<doc id="200711" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200711" title="Sanggar-sanggar filem utama">
Sanggar-sanggar filem utama

Sanggar-sanggar filem utama utawa studhio-studhio filem utama yaiku parusahan &lt;a href="Panggarapan%20filem"&gt;kirta&lt;/a&gt; lan parusahaan &lt;a href="Panganjrah%20filem"&gt;panganjrah&lt;/a&gt; sing mbabar filem kanthi cacah akèh saben taun, lan terus-terusan nampa perangan gedhé saka pangasilan &lt;a href="filem%20laris"&gt;filem laris&lt;/a&gt; ing pasar tartamtu. Ing pasaran Amérika lan &lt;a href="Negarantara"&gt;nagarantara&lt;/a&gt;, sanggar filem utama diwanuhi kanti aran majors utawa Big Five. Parusahan-parusahan iki yaiku limang &lt;a href="konglomerat%20medhia"&gt;konglomerat medhia&lt;/a&gt; sing ndarbé maneka anak parusahan kirta lan panganjrah. Anak-anak parusahan iki kanthi bebarengan asring kaanggep nguwasani wetara 80-85% pangasilan filem laris Amérika. Aran majors utawa Big Five uga sok-sok diguna kanggo anak parusahaan sing ngemunah bisnis pafileman saka konglomerat -konglomerat kasebut. Dadi ora mung kanggo aran parusahan konglomerat utamané. 
Wiwit &lt;a href="Sajarah%20filem"&gt;wujudé kirta filem&lt;/a&gt;, sanggar-sanggar filem utama Amérika wis ngendhih (mendominasi) &lt;a href="samukriya%20pafileman"&gt;samukriya pafileman&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Pafileman%20Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amerika&lt;/a&gt; lan donya. Sanggar-sanggar Amerika &lt;a href="Kauntungan%20plopor"&gt;kabegjan&lt;/a&gt; gedhé minangka pehak sing ‘mbabad alas’. Yaiku pehak kapisan sing mangun, nyamukriyani (mengindustrialisasi), tur nguwasani cara-cara nggawé lan ngwiyaraké filem-filem mutu dhuwur sing akèh lan bisa ndudut kawigatèné wong akèh saka manéka budaya. Para majors, yaiku &lt;a href="Universal%20Pictures"&gt;Universal Pictures&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Paramount%20Pictures"&gt;Paramount Pictures&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Warner%20Bros.%20Pictures"&gt;Warner Bros. Pictures&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Studios"&gt;Walt Disney Studios&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Sony%20Pictures"&gt;Sony Pictures&lt;/a&gt;, kanthi rutin nganjrah atusan filem saben taun menyang kabèh pasar-pasar nagarantara sing wigati. Parusahan parusahan iki kari ngrasakaké asil kepenak amarga wis ndarbé &lt;a href="%C3%89konomi%20skala"&gt;jaringan panganjrahan sing amba lan ndaya gunani&lt;/a&gt;, sing marakaké rata-rata beya kanggo nganjrah saben filem bisa luwih cendhak. 
Kaya-kaya ‘amèh ora mungkin’ sawijiné filem bisa ngranggèh pamirsa biyoskup nagarantara sing akèh yen ora jinupuk dening parusahan-parusahan utama iki. 
Kabeh sanggar-sanggar utama Big Five minangka anggota &lt;a href="Motion%20Picture%20Association"&gt;Motion Picture Association&lt;/a&gt; (MPA) lan &lt;a href="Alliance%20of%20Motion%20Picture%20and%20Television%20Producers"&gt;Alliance of Motion Picture and Television Producers&lt;/a&gt; (AMPTP).

</doc>
<doc id="200712" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200712" title="Universal Pictures">
Universal Pictures

Universal City Studios LLC (&lt;a href="Jeneng%20dagang"&gt;mabisnis kanthi jeneng&lt;/a&gt; Universal Pictures), lumrah diwanuhi kanti aran Universal Studios utawa mung Universal, yaiku &lt;a href="parusahan%20kirta"&gt;parusahan kirta&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Parusahan%20panganjrah"&gt;panganjrah&lt;/a&gt; (distribusi) filem Amérika Sarékat. Kantor punjeré mapan ing pasanggaran &lt;a href="10%20Universal%20City%20Plaza"&gt;Universal Studios&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Universal%20City%2C%20California"&gt;Universal City, California&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Sanggar%20filem"&gt;Sanggar&lt;/a&gt; iki minangka sanggar utama saka &lt;a href="Universal%20Filmed%20Entertainment%20Group"&gt;Universal Filmed Entertainment Group&lt;/a&gt;, taninganing (divisi) &lt;a href="NBCUniversal"&gt;NBCUniversal&lt;/a&gt;, yaiku anak parusahané &lt;a href="Comcast"&gt;Comcast&lt;/a&gt;.
Madeg ing 30 April 1912 dening by &lt;a href="Carl%20Laemmle"&gt;Carl Laemmle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mark%20Dintenfass"&gt;Mark Dintenfass&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Charles%20O.%20Baumann"&gt;Charles O. Baumann&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Adam%20Kessel"&gt;Adam Kessel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pat%20Powers"&gt;Pat Powers&lt;/a&gt;, William Swanson, &lt;a href="David%20Horsley%2C"&gt;David Horsley,&lt;/a&gt; Robert H. Cochrane, lan &lt;a href="Jules%20Brulatour"&gt;Jules Brulatour&lt;/a&gt;, parusahan iki minangka sanggar filem paling tuwa sing isih wujud ngganti sapréné ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;. Uga minangka sanggar filem paling tuwa kalima sadonya bebarengan karo &lt;a href="Gaumont"&gt;Gaumont&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Path%C3%A9"&gt;Pathé&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Titanus"&gt;Titanus&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Nordisk%20Film"&gt;Nordisk Film&lt;/a&gt;. Parusahaan iki minangka siji saka &lt;a href="Sanggar-sanggar%20filem%20utama"&gt;sanggar filem "Big Five"&lt;/a&gt;.
Waralaba filem parusahan iki sing paling kasil ing banijakarma (komersial) ana &lt;a href="Fast%20%26amp%3B%20Furious"&gt;Fast &amp; Furious&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Back%20to%20the%20Future"&gt;Back to the Future&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jurassic%20Park"&gt;Jurassic Park&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Despicable%20Me"&gt;Despicable Me&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Shrek"&gt;Shrek&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Universal%20Monsters"&gt;Universal Monsters&lt;/a&gt;. Sanggar iki uga ndarbè irah-irah filem-filem tunggal kaya &lt;a href="To%20Kill%20a%20Mockingbird"&gt;To Kill a Mockingbird&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Birds"&gt;The Birds&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Airport"&gt;Airport&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="American%20Graffiti"&gt;American Graffiti&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Sting"&gt;The Sting&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jaws"&gt;Jaws&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Smoky%20and%20the%20Bandit"&gt;Smoky and the Bandit&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="E.T.%20the%20Extra-Terrestrial"&gt;E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Breakfast%20Club"&gt;The Breakfast Club&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Backdraft"&gt;Backdraft&lt;/a&gt;, Cape Fear, The Flintstones, Casper, Twister, Liar Liar, Bring It On, How the Grinch Stole Christmas, A Beautiful Mind, Bruce Almighty, The 40-Year-Old Virgin, King Kong, Baby Mama, &lt;a href="Ted%20%28filem%29"&gt;Ted&lt;/a&gt;, Straight Outta Compton, The Secret Life of Pets, &lt;a href="Get%20Out%20%28filem%29"&gt;Get Out&lt;/a&gt;, The Invisible Man, &lt;a href="Oppenheimer%20%28filem%29"&gt;Oppenheimer&lt;/a&gt;, lan The Odyssey. Kabèh filem-filem kasebut minangka antarané &lt;a href="Prat%C3%A9lan%20filem-filem%20kanthi%20pangasilan%20kasar%20paling%20dhuwur%20ing%20sakabehing%20mangsa"&gt;filem-filem kanthi pangasilan kasar paling dhuwur ing sakabehing mangsa&lt;/a&gt;. Universal Pictures uga anggota saka &lt;a href="Motion%20Picture%20Association"&gt;Motion Picture Association&lt;/a&gt; (MPA), lan siji saka sanggar-sanggar utama “Little Three” ing &lt;a href="Pafileman%20Hollywood%20biy%C3%A8nan"&gt;jaman kuncarané Hollywood&lt;/a&gt;. Saiki, parusahan iki minangka siji saka wolung sanggar filem sangisoré &lt;a href="Universal%20Filmed%20Entertainment%20Group"&gt;Universal Filmed Entertainment Group&lt;/a&gt;. Saliya Universal Pictures uga ana &lt;a href="Focus%20Features"&gt;Focus Features&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Amblin%20Partners"&gt;Amblin Partners&lt;/a&gt; kanthi saham 20%, saha &lt;a href="United%20International%20Pictures"&gt;United International Pictures&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Working%20Title%20Films"&gt;Working Title Films&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Universal%20Animation%20Studios"&gt;Universal Animation Studios&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Illumination"&gt;Illumination&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="DreamWorks%20Animation"&gt;DreamWorks Animation&lt;/a&gt; kanthi saham 50% saben parusahan.

