<doc id="200715" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200715" title="Jane Wyatt">
Jane Wyatt

Jane Waddington Wyatt (12 Agustus 1910 – 20 Oktober 2006) iku sawijiné aktris Amérika Sarékat. Dhèwèké mbintangi sawatara film Hollywood, kaya ta &lt;a href="Frank%20Capra"&gt;Frank Capra&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Lost%20Horizon%20%28film%201937%29"&gt;Lost Horizon&lt;/a&gt;, nanging luwih dikenal amarga perané minangka ibu rumah tangga lan ibu Margaret Anderson ing seri komedi televisi &lt;a href="CBS"&gt;CBS&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="NBC"&gt;NBC&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Father%20Knows%20Best"&gt;Father Knows Best&lt;/a&gt;, lan minangka &lt;a href="Amanda%20Grayson"&gt;Amanda Grayson&lt;/a&gt;, ibu manungsa saka &lt;a href="Spock"&gt;Spock&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="program%20televisi%20fiksi%20ilmiah"&gt;program televisi fiksi ilmiah&lt;/a&gt;. Wyatt wis menangaké &lt;a href="Emmy%20Award"&gt;Emmy Award&lt;/a&gt; kaping telu.

