<doc id="200721" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200721" title="Basa-basa ing Timor Wétan">
Basa-basa ing Timor Wétan

Basa-basa ing Timor Wétan ngukup basa-bada &lt;a href="Kulawarga%20basa%20Austron%C3%A9sia"&gt;Austronesia&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="basa-basa%20Papua"&gt;basa-basa Papua&lt;/a&gt;. (Deleng &lt;a href="basa%20Timor%E2%80%93Flores"&gt;basa Timor–Flores&lt;/a&gt; lan basa &lt;a href="Timor%E2%80%93Alor%E2%80%93Pantar"&gt;Timor–Alor–Pantar&lt;/a&gt;.) &lt;a href="Basantara"&gt;Basantara&lt;/a&gt; lan basa kabangsané &lt;a href="Timor%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Timor Wétan&lt;/a&gt; yaiku basa &lt;a href="Tetum"&gt;Tetum&lt;/a&gt;, basa Austronesia sing kapabrawa dening &lt;a href="basa%20Portugis"&gt;basa Portugis&lt;/a&gt;, ing ngendi basa Portugis uga ndarbé kalungguhan pada minangka basa resmi. Basa sing dicatur ing kisma jaba (exclave) &lt;a href="Oecusse"&gt;Oecusse&lt;/a&gt; yaiku basa &lt;a href="Uab%20Meto"&gt;Uab Meto&lt;/a&gt; (Dawan). Ing perangan wétan, &lt;a href="basa%20Fataluku"&gt;basa Fataluku&lt;/a&gt;, sawijiné &lt;a href="Basa-basa%20Papuah"&gt;basa Papua&lt;/a&gt;, akèh dicatur (kala-kala luwih asring tinimbang basa Tetum). Carabasa birid basa kreol Melayu karan &lt;a href="Dili%20Melayu"&gt;Dili Melayu&lt;/a&gt; dicatur wetara padunung ing kutha krajan &lt;a href="Dili"&gt;Dili&lt;/a&gt;. Carabasa iki akèh ngresep tembung-tembung sing akèh-akèh saka basa Portugis lan basa Tetum. Basa Portugis lan basa Tetum kekaroné diakoni jroning angger-angger Timor Leste bebarengan karo basa-basa pribumi liya kaya &lt;a href="basa%20Welaun"&gt;basa Welaun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Bunak"&gt;basa Bunak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Galolen"&gt;basa Galolen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Habun"&gt;basa Habun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Idate"&gt;basa Idate&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Kawaimina"&gt;basa Kawaimina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Kemak"&gt;basa Kemak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Makuva"&gt;basa Makuva&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Makalero"&gt;basa Makalero&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Makasai"&gt;basa Makasai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Mambai"&gt;basa Mambai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="basa%20Tokodede"&gt;basa Tokodede&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="basa%20Wetar"&gt;basa Wetar&lt;/a&gt;.
Wujudé basantara ing Timor Wétan sing masarakaté nyatur akèh basa, uga anané pangendhihan (dominasi) saka sawetara suku marang suku liya, marakaké akèh basa-basa sing luwih cilik cures. Nanging, sawetara isih ana sing diguna ing upacara agama utawa dadi basa winadi mligi ing suku-suku tartamtu. Tuladhané, riset sing tumindak ing tengahan 2000-an dening juru basawidya (linguist) &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Aone%20van%20Engelenhoven"&gt;Aone van Engelenhoven&lt;/a&gt; ngewiyak yen &lt;a href="basa%20Makuva"&gt;basa Makuva&lt;/a&gt;, basa sing biyèné cinatur dening &lt;a href="suku%20Makuva"&gt;suku Makuva&lt;/a&gt;, dipracaya wis cures ing 1950-an, pranyata isih sok-sok dicatur nganti sapréné. 
Ing 2007, Van Engelenhoven nemokaké basa liya sing wis dianggep cures pranyata isih ana. Basa iki yaiku &lt;a href="basa%20Rusenu"&gt;basa Rusenu&lt;/a&gt;.

