<doc id="200723" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200723" title="Basa-basa ing Papua Niu Guinéa">
Basa-basa ing Papua Niu Guinéa

&lt;a href="Papua%20Niu%20Guin%C3%A9a"&gt;Papua Niu Guinéa&lt;/a&gt;, sawijiné &lt;a href="nagara%20wis%C3%A9sa"&gt;nagara wisésa&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Os%C3%A9ania"&gt;Oséania&lt;/a&gt;, minangka nagara &lt;a href="Basa"&gt;kanthi basa paling maneka rupa&lt;/a&gt; ing donya. &lt;a href="Ethnologue"&gt;Ethnologue&lt;/a&gt;, sawijiné sumber, ngandharaké yen ana 840 basa &lt;a href="Basa%20modh%C3%A8ren"&gt;sing isih dicatur&lt;/a&gt; nganti saiki ing nagara iki, sanadyan udakara gunggungé bisa séjé-séjé amarga &lt;a href="basa"&gt;basa&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Dhial%C3%A8k"&gt;carabasa&lt;/a&gt; bisa dimangertèni béda-béda. Ing 2006, &lt;a href="Nayakotama"&gt;Nayakotama&lt;/a&gt; Papua Niu Guinéa &lt;a href="Michael%20Somare"&gt;Michael Somare&lt;/a&gt; kandha “Papua Niu Guinéa ndarbè 832 basa sing isih dicatur kanthi sapréné (basa, dudu carabasa)." 25 saka basa-basa iki diakoni kanthi resmi. &lt;a href="Basantara"&gt;Basantara&lt;/a&gt; nagara iki (lan minangka &lt;a href="basa%20saben%20dinan"&gt;basa saben dinan&lt;/a&gt; sawetara padunung) yaiku &lt;a href="basa%20Tok%20Pisin"&gt;basa Tok Pisin&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="basa%20kreol"&gt;basa kreol&lt;/a&gt; birid &lt;a href="basa%20Inggris"&gt;basa Inggris&lt;/a&gt; (sanadyan &lt;a href="basa%20Inggris%20baku"&gt;basa Inggris baku&lt;/a&gt; umumé dianggo ing &lt;a href="Papr%C3%A8ntahan"&gt;rèh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="pawiyatan"&gt;pawiyatan&lt;/a&gt;, lan tetulisan resmi). 
Akèh-akèh basa-basa iki kalebu &lt;a href="Basa-basa%20Papuah"&gt;basa pribumi Papua&lt;/a&gt; sing mangun &lt;a href="sprachbund"&gt;sprachbund&lt;/a&gt; saindhenging pulo &lt;a href="Irian"&gt;Papua&lt;/a&gt;. Maneka &lt;a href="Kulawarga%20basa%20Austron%C3%A9sia"&gt;basa Austronesia&lt;/a&gt; uga dicatur ing nagara iki, sing akèh-akèh kalebu &lt;a href="basa%20Os%C3%A9ania%20Kulon"&gt;basa Oséania Kulon&lt;/a&gt;. Basa-basa kaya &lt;a href="basa%20Kapuloan%20Admiralty"&gt;basa Kapuloan Admiralty&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="basa%20Polinesia%20Ellicean%E2%80%93Outlier"&gt;basa Polinesia Ellicean–Outlier&lt;/a&gt; uga dicaturaké ing sawetara pulo-pulo jaba. Wiwit pungkasan abad ka-19, &lt;a href="basawangsa%20J%C3%A9rman%20Kulon"&gt;basawangsa Jérman Kulon&lt;/a&gt;, yaiku basa Inggris lan basa Jérman, uga dicatur lan dadi basa kreol kaya basa Tok Pisin, &lt;a href="basa%20Kreol%20Supitan%20Torres"&gt;basa Kreol Supitan Torres&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="basa%20Unserdeutsch"&gt;basa Unserdeutsch&lt;/a&gt;.
Basa-basa sing wis diakoni kanthi ukum yaiku basa Tok Pisin, basa Inggris, &lt;a href="basa%20Hiri%20Motu"&gt;basa Hiri Motu&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Basa%20Sasmita%20Papua%20Niu%20Guin%C3%A9a"&gt;Basa Sasmita Papua Niu Guinéa&lt;/a&gt;. Basa Sasmita Papua Niu Guinéa minangka basa kapapat sing diakoni kanthi resmi ing Mei 2015. Basa iki diguna dening para &lt;a href="Kelangan%20parungu"&gt;tuna rungu&lt;/a&gt; ing saindhenging nagara iki.

