<doc id="200724" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200724" title="One Piece (serial TV 2023)">
One Piece (serial TV 2023)

One Piece (dimodhèl nganggo aksara &lt;a href="sarwa%20murda"&gt;sarwa murda&lt;/a&gt;) yaiku serial tivi &lt;a href="Rekan%20lembara"&gt;lembara&lt;/a&gt; (petualangan) &lt;a href="Acara%20t%C3%A9l%C3%A9visi%20kayal"&gt;kayal&lt;/a&gt; anggitan Matt Owens lan &lt;a href="Steven%20Maede"&gt;Steven Maede&lt;/a&gt; kanggo &lt;a href="Netflix"&gt;Netflix&lt;/a&gt;. Serial iki minangka salin pacak (adaptasi) &lt;a href="lakon%20nyata"&gt;lakon nyata&lt;/a&gt; (live action) saka serial komik Jepang 1997, One Piece, anggitan &lt;a href="Eiichiro%20Oda"&gt;Eiichiro Oda&lt;/a&gt;. Ing salin pacak iki Oda uga minangka paranpara (penasihat) kreatifé. Serial iki dikirta (diproduksi) dening Kaji Production lan &lt;a href="Shueisha"&gt;Shueisha&lt;/a&gt;, yaiku pambabar komiké. Juru paraga ing serial iki ana &lt;a href="I%C3%B1aki%20Godoy"&gt;Iñaki Godoy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Emily%20Rudd"&gt;Emily Rudd&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mackenyu"&gt;Mackenyu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jacob%20Romero%20Gibson"&gt;Jacob Romero Gibson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Taz%20Skylar"&gt;Taz Skylar&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Mikaela%20Hoover"&gt;Mikaela Hoover&lt;/a&gt; minangka Bendhega Bajag Topi Dedami (Kru Bajak Laut Topi Jerami), bebarengan karo juru paraga utama liya kaya &lt;a href="Morgan%20Davies"&gt;Morgan Davies&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Vincent%20Regan"&gt;Vincent Regan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jeff%20Ward"&gt;Jeff Ward&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Charithra%20Chandran"&gt;Charithra Chandran&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lera%20Abova"&gt;Lera Abova&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Joe%20Manganiello"&gt;Joe Manganiello&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Sendhil%20Ramamurthy"&gt;Sendhil Ramamurthy&lt;/a&gt;.
One Piece nampa pesenan &lt;a href="langsung%20samangsa%20wutuh"&gt;langsung samangsa wutuh&lt;/a&gt; (straight-to-series) saka Netflix ing Januari 2020, lan suting tumandang antarané Januari lan Agustus 2022. Sakabèh episode mangsa kapisan dibabar bebarengan ing 31 Agustus 2023. Rong minggu sawisé, Netflix ngwara mangsa kapindhoné, kanthi naskahé rampung ing Sèptèmber 2023, sanadyan kasèp amarga ana &lt;a href="mogok%20SAG-AFTRA"&gt;mogok SAG-AFTRA&lt;/a&gt;. Mangsa kanthi irah-irahan Into the Grand Line kasebut banjur suting antarané Juni lan Dhésèmber 2024, banjur dibabar ing 10 Maret 2026. Ing Agustus 2025, Netflix ngwara kanggo mangsa katelu, sing dikirta ing November 2025, adoh sadurungé mangsa kapindo tayang pradana (premiere). Mangsa iki diirah-irahi Battle of Alabasta lan dikira-kira tayang pradana ing 2027.
Serial iki nampa biji apik saka kritikawan lan para panggandrungé. Aktingé, visualé, adengan lagané, banyolané, lan kacocogan tumrap karya asalé dielem apik. Akèh sing kandha yen serial iki minangka salah sawijiné salin pacak lakon nyata saka manga utawa &lt;a href="anime"&gt;anime&lt;/a&gt; sing paling becik. One Piece minangka acara Netflix paling akèh ditongton (katandhing mangsa-mangsa tunggal serial liya) sasuwé perang kapindho 2023.

</doc>
<doc id="200725" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200725" title="The Great Flood (filem)">
The Great Flood (filem)

The Great Flood (&lt;a href="Hangeul"&gt;Hangul&lt;/a&gt;: 대홍수), yaiku &lt;a href="filem%20wancana"&gt;filem wancana&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Filem%20rekan%20%C3%A8lmiyah"&gt;rekan èlmiyah&lt;/a&gt; (fiksi ilmiah) sing disutradharani &lt;a href="Kim%20Byung-woo"&gt;Kim Byung-woo&lt;/a&gt; lan naskah ditulis dening dhèwèké bareng &lt;a href="Han%20Ji-su"&gt;Han Ji-su&lt;/a&gt;. Dijuruparagani &lt;a href="Kim%20Da-mi"&gt;Kim Da-mi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Park%20Hae-soo"&gt;Park Hae-soo&lt;/a&gt;, filem iki nyritakaké rekasané wong-wong sing putek ngudi kaslametan ing dina-dina pungkasané manungsa jroning apartemèn sing katerak banjir gedhèn. 
