<doc id="200742" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200742" title="Lindhu Venezuela 2026">
Lindhu Venezuela 2026

Ing 24 Juni 2026, rong lindhu gedhé jinis &lt;a href="rengkan%20malang"&gt;rengkan malang&lt;/a&gt; (patahan mendatar) &lt;a href="Punjer%20lindhu"&gt;Punjeré lindhu&lt;/a&gt; kapisan ana ing &lt;a href="munisipalitas%20Veroes"&gt;munisipalitas Veroes&lt;/a&gt;, kuloné &lt;a href="San%20Felipe%20%28Venezuela%29"&gt;San Felipe&lt;/a&gt;, kutha krajan praja &lt;a href="Yaracuy"&gt;Yaracuy&lt;/a&gt;. Lindhu kanthi gedhé iki wiwit ing 18.04 &lt;a href="Wektu%20ing%20Venezuela"&gt;VET&lt;/a&gt; lan kalebu &lt;a href="lindhu%20wiwitan"&gt;lindhu wiwitan&lt;/a&gt; (gempa permulaan). Lindhu iki banjur ditut lindhu utama gedhéné Mw 7,5 30 detik sawisé, sing punjeré ana pasisir &lt;a href="La%20Guaira"&gt;La Guaira&lt;/a&gt;, kuloné &lt;a href="Catia%20La%20Mar"&gt;Catia La Mar&lt;/a&gt;. Rong lindhu iki marakaké karusakan ing saindhengé nagara, utamané ing kutha krajan &lt;a href="Caracas"&gt;Caracas&lt;/a&gt; lan praja La Guaira. Ing rong papan iki wewangunan 80% ajur mumur.Ing Augustus 2026, 6.300 wong punjul dilapuraké pati, wetara 73,300 dirumat ing griya sakit, lan 10.000 isih ilang.
Tata piranti &lt;a href="Prompt%20Assessment%20of%20Global%20Earthquakes%20for%20Response"&gt;Prompt Assessment of Global Earthquakes for Response&lt;/a&gt; (PAGER) duwèké &lt;a href="United%20States%20Geological%20Survey"&gt;United States Geological Survey&lt;/a&gt; (USGS) nitikira gunggungé korban pati bisa munjuli lapuran wiwitan, bisa waé ngeluwihi 10.000 wong. &lt;a href="Lindhu%20utama"&gt;Lindhu utama&lt;/a&gt; sing nerak iki minangka lindhu paling banter ing Vènezuéla kawit &lt;a href="Lindhu%20San%20Narcisco%20taun%201900"&gt;lindhu San Narcisco ing 1900&lt;/a&gt;.
