<doc id="200743" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200743" title="Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures">
Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures

Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures yaiku &lt;a href="panganjrah%20filem"&gt;panganjrah filem&lt;/a&gt; (distributor film) jroning taningan (divisi) &lt;a href="Disney%20Entertainment"&gt;Disney Entertainment&lt;/a&gt; duwèké &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Company"&gt;Walt Disney Company&lt;/a&gt;. Parusahan iki ngurusi panjrahan kanggo biyoskup lan kadhang panjrahan dhigital, pamasaran, lan grenawarta (promosi) kanggo filem-filem garapan uga babaran &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Studios"&gt;Walt Disney Studios&lt;/a&gt;, kalebu &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Pictures"&gt;Walt Disney Pictures&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Disney%20Original%20Documentary"&gt;Disney Original Documentary&lt;/a&gt; (namung babaran biyoskup winates), &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Animation%20Studios"&gt;Walt Disney Animation Studios&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pixar"&gt;Pixar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Marvel%20Studios"&gt;Marvel Studios&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lucasfilm"&gt;Lucasfilm&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="20th%20Century%20Studios"&gt;20th Century Studios&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Searchlight%20Pictures"&gt;Searchlight Pictures&lt;/a&gt;, sanajan ékan (unit) sinebut ing pungkasan ngemunah ékan panganjrah lan pamasarané dhéwé ing Amérika Sarékat.
Parusahan iki wiwit diadegaké dening &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney"&gt;Walt Disney&lt;/a&gt; ing 1953 kanthi jeneng Buena Vista Film Distribution Company Inc., banjur salin jeneng Buena Vista Distribution Inc. lan Buena Vista Pictures Distribution Inc..Parusahan iki maguna jeneng kaya sapréné wiwit pungkasan 2007. 

