<doc id="200744" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=200744" title="Walt Disney Studios">
Walt Disney Studios

Walt Disney Studios yaiku taningan (divisi) saka juring (segmen) usaha &lt;a href="Disney%20Entertainment"&gt;Disney Entertainment&lt;/a&gt; duwèké &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Company"&gt;Walt Disney Company&lt;/a&gt;. Parusahan iki kawentar amarga ndarbé maneka &lt;a href="sanggar%20filem"&gt;sanggar filem&lt;/a&gt; ing jeroné. Adeg nalika 16 Oktober 1923, parusahan iki minangka sanggar filem paling gedhé ing &lt;a href="Hollywood"&gt;Hollywood&lt;/a&gt;, sing mapan ing pasanggaran (studio lot) &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Studios%20%28Burbank%29"&gt;Walt Disney Studios&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Burbank%2C%20California"&gt;Burbank, California&lt;/a&gt;. Parusahan iki uga minangka sanggar filem paling tuwa kapitu sadonya lan paling tuwa kalima ing Amérika Sarékat, anggota &lt;a href="Motion%20Picture%20Association"&gt;Motion Picture Association&lt;/a&gt; (MPA), tur siji saka “Limang Gedhé” &lt;a href="Sanggar-sanggar%20filem%20utama"&gt;sanggar filem utama&lt;/a&gt;. 
Walt Disney Studios ndarbé parusahan-parusahan panggarap filem kawentar kaya &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Pictures"&gt;Walt Disney Pictures&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Animation%20Studios"&gt;Walt Disney Animation Studios&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pixar%20Animation%20Studios"&gt;Pixar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Marvel%20Studios"&gt;Marvel Studios&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lucasfilm"&gt;Lucasfilm&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="20th%20Century%20Fox"&gt;20th Century Studios&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Searchlight%20Pictures"&gt;Searchlight Pictures&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Studios%20Motion%20Pictures"&gt;Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures&lt;/a&gt; nganjrah (mendistribusikan) lan masaraké sapérangan gedhé momotan (konten) sing digarap dening sanggar-sanggar iki kanggo panayangan ing biyoskup tur kanggo &lt;a href="Disney%20Streaming"&gt;leladi wilenan&lt;/a&gt; (streaming service) duwèké parusahan. Ing taun 2029, Disney nyathet rekor samukriya (industri) cacahé $13.2 milyar filem laris (box office) sadonya. Sanggar iki ndarbé wolu saka sapuluh &lt;a href="Pratelan%20filem%20kanthi%20pikantuk%20kasar%20paling%20dhuwur"&gt;filem kanthi pikantuk kasar paling dhuwur&lt;/a&gt; sadonya ing sakabehing mangsa, uga wetara waralaba &lt;a href="Pratelan%20filem%20kanthi%20pikantuk%20kasar%20paling%20dhuwur"&gt;filem kanthi pikantuk kasar paling dhuwuring&lt;/a&gt; sakabehé mangsa.

