Andrea Martin

Andrea Louise Martin (lair 15 Januari 1947) iku aktris lan juru lawak Amérika Sarékat lan Kanada, dhèwèké misuwur olèhé main ing serial televisi &lt;a href="Second%20City%20Television"&gt;SCTV&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="Great%20News"&gt;Great News&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké wis tau main ing film-film kaya ta &lt;a href="Black%20Christmas%20%28film%201974%29"&gt;Black Christmas&lt;/a&gt; (1974) lan panggawèan ulangé in taun 2006, &lt;a href="Wag%20the%20Dog"&gt;Wag the Dog&lt;/a&gt; (1997), &lt;a href="Hedwig%20and%20the%20Angry%20Inch%20%28film%29"&gt;Hedwig and the Angry Inch&lt;/a&gt; (2001), &lt;a href="My%20Big%20Fat%20Greek%20Wedding"&gt;My Big Fat Greek Wedding&lt;/a&gt; (2002), &lt;a href="My%20Big%20Fat%20Greek%20Wedding%202"&gt;My Big Fat Greek Wedding 2&lt;/a&gt; (2016), &lt;a href="Little%20Italy%20%28film%202018%29"&gt;Little Italy&lt;/a&gt; (2018) lan &lt;a href="My%20Big%20Fat%20Greek%20Wedding%203"&gt;My Big Fat Greek Wedding 3&lt;/a&gt; (2023). Martin uga dadi juru sulih swara sing prodhuktif, ngisèni swara kanggo akèh sèri animasi lan film kalebu, &lt;a href="Anastasia%20%281997%20film%29"&gt;Anastasia&lt;/a&gt; (1997), &lt;a href="The%20Rugrats%20Movie"&gt;The Rugrats Movie&lt;/a&gt; (1998), lan (2001). Saka taun 2021 nganti 2024, dhèwèké mbintangi serial drama supranatural Evil. Dhèwèké main paragabola-bali ing &lt;a href="Only%20Murders%20in%20the%20Building"&gt;Only Murders in the Building&lt;/a&gt; #ALIH.
Pakaryané Andrea Martin uga akèh sajroné donya téater, menangaké &lt;a href="Tony%20Awards"&gt;Tony Awards&lt;/a&gt; kanggo &lt;a href="My%20Favorite%20Year%20%28musical%29"&gt;My Favorite Year&lt;/a&gt; lan panggawéan ulang &lt;a href="Pippin%20%28musikal%29"&gt;Pippin&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 2013. Andrea Martin uga tau main ing Broadway ing &lt;a href="Candide"&gt;Candide&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Oklahoma%21"&gt;Oklahoma!&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Fiddler%20on%20the%20Roof"&gt;Fiddler on the Roof&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Young%20Frankenstein%20%28musical%29"&gt;Young Frankenstein&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Exit%20the%20King"&gt;Exit the King&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Act%20One%20%28play%29"&gt;Act One&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké tau oleh limang nominasi kanggo &lt;a href="Tony%20Award%20for%20Best%20Featured%20Actress%20in%20a%20Musical"&gt;Tony Award for Best Featured Actress in a Musical&lt;/a&gt;, iki akèh dhéwé tinimbang aktris liyané sajroné sajarah bebungah iki. Dhèwèké uga olèh nomansi kapisané kanggo &lt;a href="Tony%20Award%20for%20Best%20Featured%20Actress%20in%20a%20Play"&gt;Tony Award for Best Featured Actress in a Play&lt;/a&gt; kanggo panggawéan ulang &lt;a href="Noises%20Off"&gt;Noises Off&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 2016.
